From 1997be9a73f1fbe0b87cc9f3ff4915b2d115c158 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:35:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/18] test-posix: Check the speed functions and the speeds
 tcsetattr sets

cfsetispeed and cfsetospeed store exactly what they are given, B0
included, and tcsetattr passes the speeds on: B0 input means the output
speed, and split speeds are set together or not at all. cfsetspeed sets
both speeds.
---
